![Screenshot of the setup](cover.png)

A simple project to document the environment setup for Elixir
development on a Raspberry Pi 4.

It will also mostly work for any Debian 11.

The idea is to have a minimalist yet pretty environment that carries
all the tools needed to develop Elixir projects.

## Hardware components

- Rasperry PI 4 Model B 8GB Ram bought at <https://altronics.cl/>
- Kingstone 32 GB SD card (KN3-042).

```github
ElixirCL/machine | Elixir corriendo en máquinas pequeñas como la Raspberry Pi
```
